    "observations": [
      "Three real training examples already have zero error on their sparse known labels; the fourth near-perfect example remains unchanged. The improvement is concentrated in printed hearts and floral/striped checker paper.",
      "Both continuations preserve many plain silhouettes but retain cat noise and fail to distinguish some printed stripes, dots, trees and lettering from cuts.",
      "Mixed supervision produces a cleaner star mask and suppresses more purple floral ink, but both continuations pass the star fit; purple floral paper still fails the complete pipeline.",
      "The tilted candle gains mask noise near the lower border; both final fits fail.",
      "Dinosaur routing changes substantially despite only 334 of 160000 mask pixels changing relative to the parent.",
      "The central printed flower still passes self-mask checks as a cut motif; this is not material-identity recovery.",
      "Wrong basket/building crops and all six unresolved proposals remain in the denominator.",
      "Detailed motifs such as the girl with birds and the diving figure have recognizable masks but badly simplified fitted curves; this is a separate fitting limitation."
    ]
